desktop.ini

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/

# Training artifacts (policies are committed deliberately, logs are not)
runs/
logs/
wandb/
*.ckpt

# MuJoCo drops this next to whatever invoked it
MUJOCO_LOG.TXT

# Progress clips are derived artefacts: the rollout is deterministic, so any of them
# can be regenerated exactly from the committed policy alongside them.
# Committing ~90 MB of video to reproduce something already reproducible is waste.
#
# Both spellings on purpose. Results moved from one shared progress/videos/ to a
# per-run progress/runs/<run>/videos/ so that a new training run starts with an empty
# dashboard instead of the previous run's scores; the old path is kept so a checkout
# predating that move still ignores its clips rather than offering 180 MB for commit.
progress/videos/
progress/runs/*/videos/
